flowchart TD
    %% MVP enterprise entry; individual preservation is deferred.
    %% Sources: brainstorm/00_context.md Scope, A-017, prope_source_of_truth.md S1 and MVP.

    start([Start: authenticated enterprise member opens Prope])
    registry[Permission-filtered Registry]
    has_visible{Any visible prompt properties?}
    empty[Registry Empty State]
    register_handoff([Continue to 02 Register Prompt])
    search[Search and Filter Registry]
    select[Select a visible prompt property]
    detail[Prompt Property Detail]
    next{Member goal}
    find_handoff([Continue to 03 Find Trusted Prompt])
    access_handoff([Continue to 04 Manage Ownership and Access])
    revision_handoff([Continue to 05 Manage Revisions])

    start --> registry
    registry --> has_visible
    has_visible -->|No| empty
    empty -->|Register prompt| register_handoff
    has_visible -->|Yes| search
    search -->|No result| empty
    search -->|Matching visible record| select
    select --> detail
    detail --> next
    next -->|Identify trusted revision| find_handoff
    next -->|Manage access, if permitted| access_handoff
    next -->|Create revision, if permitted| revision_handoff

    %% Individual save → find → reuse is intentionally absent from the MVP (A-017).
